### 1. Semantic Labels
```dart
// Provide semantic information
Semantics(
  label: 'Save button',
  hint: 'Tap to save the transaction',
  child: ElevatedButton(
    onPressed: () {},
    child: Icon(Icons.save),
  ),
)
```

### 2. Screen Reader Support
```dart
// Announce changes to screen readers
SemanticsService.announce('Transaction saved', TextDirection.ltr);

// Provide live regions
Semantics(
  liveRegion: true,
  child: Text(statusMessage),
